verdict = "task"
evidence = "The unavailable GetReceiptKeys branch still returns errSequencerReceiptNotServed at rpc/sequencer_receipt.go:359, whose message names pax_sequencerReceipt at rpc/sequencer_receipt.go:74 and whose code is -32000 at rpc/sequencer_receipt.go:54 and rpc/sequencer_receipt.go:77, while rpc/sequencer_receipt_test.go:476 checks only the code and services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/boot.rs:146 requires receipt-key retrieval for readiness."
close_comment = "Confirmed: px_getReceiptKeys returns an unavailable-method error naming pax_sequencerReceipt when no local source or forwarding endpoint is configured. The follow-up RPC task will name px_getReceiptKeys in that response while preserving error code -32000 and the existing pax_sequencerReceipt response."

